summary: Filed and worked through the four lower-priority convene findings. Cid's captain-board 'settlement-debt blind spot' was REFUTED on verification (settledAt is epic-level by design; a child sweep would false-positive on every done task). Probe's oracle falsifiability gap was closed (exported score(), added a partition test positively exercising the two previously-uncovered cells agreeConflict and divergeGitOnly). Mika's contrast failures were fixed in system.html (4 informational --cut texts promoted to --linen-400, --seam floor guard added). North's moat-vs-demo finding is a product decision, filed to the human (T-008).
